# JS Code Quality (classic ASPX)

`00-core-fsm` (anti-overengineering / anti-sycophancy) နှင့် `14-security-appsec` လိုက်နာ။
ဤ tree မှာ `01-react-standards` သို့ React/Next MUST rules **မသက်ဆိုင်**။

## Mindsets
- Simplicity · readability · maintainability — premature micro-opts ထက်
- Less code = less debt
- **Minimal diffs** — task သက်ဆိုင်ရာသာ; drive-by cleanup မလုပ်

## Naming
- `camelCase` functions/vars; `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` module constants
- Units in names (`timeoutMs`); collections plural; booleans = questions
- Event handlers `handle*`
- Domain name သိရင် leftover `d`, `tmp`, `obj`, `x`, သို့ vague `data` မသုံး

## Guidelines
- Early returns — deep nesting ထက်
- Small pure helpers — sprawling functions ထက်
- DRY — duplication real and stable ဖြစ်မှ
- Rejected promises handle (`await` / `.catch` / intentional `void` + why)
- `fetch` မှာ `res.ok` စစ်

## Globals (ASPX-safe)
- Ad-hoc `window.*` ထက် IIFE / one namespaced object prefer
- Secrets ကို `window` **NEVER** stash; SharePoint host globals — task မလိုရ unless ထိ

## Comments
- **English only** (`00` Language) — non-English တွေ့ရင် rewrite
- WHY only။ Workarounds: reason + date

## Reject
- Library အသစ် approval မရှိဘဲ ထည့်
- Classic controller JS ကို classic tree ထဲ React/SPFx အဖြစ် convert
- `eval` / unsafe `innerHTML` with user data (`14-security-appsec`)
